flowchart TD
    A[Client accesses Landing] --> B[react-i18next detects Accept-Language header]
    B --> C{Language detected?}
    C -->|Spanish| D[Set locale = es]
    C -->|English| E[Set locale = en]
    C -->|Other/missing| D
    D --> F[Landing renders in Spanish]
    E --> G[Landing renders in English]
    F --> H[Client can toggle language via header selector]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Preference persisted in localStorage]

    I --> J{Client submits form?}
    J -->|Quote request| K[Send X-Locale header with current locale]
    J -->|Complaint| K
    J -->|Purchase| K
    K --> L[api-core persists locale in record's locale column]

    L --> M{System needs to send email?}
    M -->|Purchase confirmation| N[Select template by record.locale]
    M -->|Quote sent| N
    M -->|Acceptance/Rejection| N
    M -->|Payment receipt| N
    M -->|Complaint receipt| N
    M -->|Expiration notice| N
    M -->|Postponement| N
    N --> O[Send email in record's language]
    O --> P[Language is consistent across all emails for same process]

    style K fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00
    style L fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00
    style N fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
